" alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p10"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>10</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>MULTIPLE CUSTOMERS MOVE THROUGH AT THE SAME TIME</h2><div class="ja-title">無人でも、複数のお客様を同時に止めない。</div><p class="lead">購入と加熱を一列に並べず、画面案内と複数の加熱機器で流れを分散します。<span class="en">Purchase and heating do not share one queue. On-screen guidance and multiple heating units keep several customers moving at once.</span></p><div class="body"><div class="flow"><div>CHOOSE<small>写真・原材料・アレルギーを多言語表示</small></div><div>PAY<small>キャッシュレスで無人決済</small></div><div>HEAT<small>指定機器と時間を画面で案内</small></div><div>GO<small>片手で持ち、すぐ会場へ戻る</small></div></div><div class="quote">一人が温めている間にも、次のお客様は購入できます。<span class="en">While one guest is heating, the next guest can already buy.</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p11"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>11</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>TURN HEATING TIME INTO BRAND TIME</h2><div class="ja-title">温める数分間を、ブランドを知る時間に変える。</div><p class="lead">実際のブース内で、来場者が加熱を待つ間に、生産者・サルバトーレ・協賛ブランドの物語に触れます。<span class="en">Inside the booth, guests discover producers, Salvatore and partner brands while their food heats.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>生産者の顔・産地・素材の背景を映像で紹介<span class="en">Show producers, regions and ingredient stories</span></li><li>S.PELLEGRINOなど協賛ブランドの広告を掲出<span class="en">Feature partner advertising such as S.PELLEGRINO</span></li><li>商品ごとに表示内容を切り替える<span class="en">Switch content according to the selected product</span></li><li>待ち時間を、理解と次の購買につながる時間へ変える<span class="en">Turn waiting into understanding and future purchase intent</span></li></ul></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p12"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>12</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>SELL EVERY PRODUCT. WASTE NOTHING.</h2><div class="ja-title">つくった商品を、捨てない。</div><p class="lead">冷凍と販売データで、つくった美味しさを最後まで届け切ります。<span class="en">Frozen storage and sales data help every product reach a customer instead of becoming waste.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>長い販売期限で販売機会を増やす<span class="en">Extend the window of opportunity to sell</span></li><li>販売数に合わせて製造と補充を調整<span class="en">Align production and restocking with demand</span></li><li>余剰在庫を別拠点・次回販売へ移動<span class="en">Redirect surplus to another site or sales period</span></li><li>在庫・補充・販売を記録して改善<span class="en">Track inventory, restocking and sales</span></li></ul></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p13"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>13</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>OUR EXPO MODEL PROVED THE ALTERNATIVE WORKS.</h2><div class="ja-title">大阪万博では、この仕組みで供給の停滞を避けた。</div><p class="lead">会場内のレストランでは客席が埋まり供給が止まる場面がある一方、私たちは席と厨房に依存しない販売で来場者へ食事を届け続けました。<span class="en">While conventional restaurants were constrained by occupied seating, our model kept serving visitors without depending on tables or made-to-order kitchen capacity.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>お客様自身の加熱により、会計と調理待ちを分離<span class="en">Self-heating separated checkout from preparation waiting</span></li><li>冷凍のまま販売し、来場者数の急増・急減に対応<span class="en">Frozen inventory absorbed sharp rises and falls in attendance</span></li><li>客席を必要とせず、購入後すぐ会場へ戻れる<span class="en">No seating required—guests could return to the Expo immediately</span></li><li>飲食需要に供給が追いつかない状況を補い、食べ物不足の改善に貢献<span class="en">The model supplemented limited food capacity and helped ease visitor food shortages</span></li></ul><div class="quote">問題を見つけただけではない。大阪万博で、すでに解決方法を実践した。<span class="en">We did not merely identify the problem. We already proved a solution at Expo 2025.</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide " id="p14"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>14</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>NOT A VENDING MACHINE—A COMPACT FOOD INFRASTRUCTURE</h2><div class="ja-title">自販機ではなく、小さな食のインフラをつくる。</div><p class="lead">冷凍庫、決済、加熱機器、映像、広告、補充導線を一つの販売空間として設計します。<span class="en">Freezers, payment, heating, media, advertising and restocking are designed as one integrated retail space.</span></p><div class="body"><ul><li>長時間稼働できる無人販売<span class="en">Long-hour unmanned operation</span></li><li>複数機器でピーク能力を拡張<span class="en">Scalable peak capacity with multiple units</span></li><li>多言語で購入・加熱を案内<span class="en">Multilingual purchase and heating guidance</span></li><li>販売データで商品構成を改善<span class="en">Data-led assortment improvement</span></li></ul></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide wide" id="p15"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>15</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>BRING GREAT TASTE TO MORE PLACES</h2><div class="ja-title">美味しさが届く範囲を、もっと広くする。</div><p class="lead">レストランを増やすだけではなく、自販機を通じて料理人の品質と出会える場所を増やします。<span class="en">Beyond opening restaurants, ITALYERIA vending creates more places to encounter chef-driven quality.</span></p><div class="body"><div class="vision">ホテル、駅・空港、オフィス、海外へ。<span class="en">Hotels, transport hubs, offices and overseas markets.</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64," alt=""><div class="shade"></div></figure></section>
<section class="slide wide" id="p16"><div class="meta"><span>ITALYERIA / GREEN×EXPO 2027</span><b>16</b></div><div class="copy"><h2>BUILD THE FUTURE OF FOOD RETAIL HERE</h2><div class="ja-title">未来の販売空間を、ここから始める。</div><p class="lead">万博運営の経験、国内各地の販売実績、料理人の開発力。そのすべてをITALYERIAの無人空間へ。<span class="en">Expo experience, nationwide sales and chef-led development—brought together in one unmanned ITALYERIA space.</span></p><div class="body"><div class="quote">人に依存しない。席に依存しない。それでも、美味しさは妥協しない。<span class="en">Independent of staffing. Independent of seating. Never compromising on taste.</span></div></div></div><figure><img src="data:image/png;base64,